...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down

user: 사용자 (브라우저) { class: person }
agents: 2_model_agnostic_agent/ {
  direction: down
  pkg1: 2_1_openai_adk_agent/ {
    agent: root_agent (agent.py) { class: ours }
  }
  pkg2: 2_2_anthropic_adk_agent/ {
    agent: root_agent (agent.py) { class: ours }
  }
}
tool: get_fun_fact 도구 { class: ours }
env: API 키 (.env, OPENROUTER_API_KEY) { class: file }
adk_web: adk web 서버 { class: ext }
openrouter: 모델 게이트웨이 (OpenRouter API) { class: ext }

user -> adk_web: 채팅 메시지 (POST /run)
adk_web -> agents.pkg1.agent: 이름 검증 후 동적 임포트
adk_web -> agents.pkg2.agent: 마찬가지
env -> agents.pkg1.agent: OPENROUTER_API_KEY
env -> agents.pkg2.agent: 마찬가지
agents.pkg1.agent -> tool: tools 파라미터로 연결
agents.pkg2.agent -> tool: tools 파라미터로 연결
agents.pkg1.agent -> openrouter: openrouter/openai/gpt-4o 요청
agents.pkg2.agent -> openrouter: openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-4 요청
openrouter -> adk_web: 생성된 응답
adk_web -> user: 응답 표시
